    "Neve, petali, foglie, lucciole, stelle cadenti, pioggia sul vetro, temporale, nebbia e nuvole. Li scegli dal menu di Sbu Seasons → Effetto, con l'intensità subito sotto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Snow, petals, leaves, fireflies, shooting stars, rain on the glass, thunderstorms, mist and clouds. Pick one from the Sbu Seasons menu → Effect, with the intensity just below."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schnee, Blütenblätter, Blätter, Glühwürmchen, Sternschnuppen, Regen auf der Scheibe, Gewitter, Nebel und Wolken. Du wählst sie im Menü von Sbu Seasons → Effekt, die Intensität gleich darunter."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neige, pétales, feuilles, lucioles, étoiles filantes, pluie sur la vitre, orage, brume et nuages. Tu les choisis dans le menu de Sbu Seasons → Effet, avec l’intensité juste en dessous."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nieve, pétalos, hojas, luciérnagas, estrellas fugaces, lluvia en el cristal, tormenta, niebla y nubes. Los eliges en el menú de Sbu Seasons → Efecto, con la intensidad justo debajo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雪、花びら、葉っぱ、ホタル、流れ星、窓に雨、雷雨、霧、雲。Sbu Seasonsのメニュー → エフェクト から選べます。強さはそのすぐ下にあります。"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neve, pétalas, folhas, vaga-lumes, estrelas cadentes, chuva no vidro, tempestade, névoa e nuvens. Você escolhe no menu do Sbu Seasons → Efeito, com a intensidade logo abaixo."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sneeuw, bloemblaadjes, bladeren, vuurvliegjes, vallende sterren, regen op het raam, onweer, mist en wolken. Je kiest ze in het menu van Sbu Seasons → Effect, met de intensiteit er direct onder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
